{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a7c3e1d0-8b2f-4c19-9e4a-jwt-security-demo",
    "name": "Spring Boot JWT Security",
    "description": "API collection for the local JWT demo on http://localhost:8001.\n\nHow to use:\n1. Import this file into Postman (Import → file).\n2. Start the app (`./mvnw spring-boot:run`).\n3. Run **Auth → Register Admin** (or **Login seeded Admin**) first so `access_token` / `refresh_token` are set.\n4. Run other folders. Collection variables are updated by test scripts.\n\nSeeded on startup (non-test profile):\n- admin@mail.com / password (ADMIN)\n- manager@mail.com / password (MANAGER)\n\nRoles: USER, MANAGER, ADMIN.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8001" },
    { "key": "access_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "refresh_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "admin_access_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "admin_refresh_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "manager_access_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "user_access_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "user_refresh_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "book_id", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register Admin",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('register admin 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('tokens present', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(json.access_token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "  pm.expect(json.refresh_token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "});",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('admin_access_token', json.access_token);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('admin_refresh_token', json.refresh_token);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', json.access_token);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', json.refresh_token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"firstname\": \"Ali\",\n  \"lastname\": \"Admin\",\n  \"email\": \"admin.postman@mail.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password\",\n  \"role\": \"ADMIN\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register"
          }
        },
